e active workspace.\n   - Resolution: Restored `.openclaw` back to `/home/azureuser/.openclaw` via `mv`, confirmed workspace directory integrity, and relaunched the master pipeline orchestrator as `task-12133` (`python3 \"Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/run_cluster_pipeline.py\"`).\n2. **ChatGPT Dynamic DOM & MarkdownRoot Selector Update:**\n   - Problem: ChatGPT changed its response DOM so that neither `div[data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"]` nor `article[data-testid*=\"conversation-turn-\"]` reliably matched generated turns, throwing `ChatGPT stream completed but no output text could be captured`.\n   - Resolution: Updated `worker_server.py` to target `[class*=\"MarkdownRoot\" i], [class*=\"markdown\" i], [data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"]`, and added synthetic `input` event dispatch on `#prompt-textarea`/`.ProseMirror` to ensure React recognizes inserted text.\n3. **Modal Dialog Auto-Dismissal:**\n   - Problem: ChatGPT's \"More relevant, personalized replies\" modal popup intercepted editor input.\n   - Resolution: Added JavaScript-based button clicker in `dismiss_dialogs_and_pick_account` and `keyboard.press(\"Escape\")` to dismiss dialogs unconditionally.\n4. **Target Crashed / 429 Reset Routine:**\n   - When a worker encounters `Page.evaluate: Target crashed` (Chromium renderer OOM) or `HTTP Error 429: Too Many Requests`, running `sg docker -c \"docker restart <container_name>\"` immediately brings up a clean persistent browser session in ~10-15s with automatic session verification.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Active Background Cron Task:** `task-9328` (Recurring cron: `0,30 * * * *`), fires every 30 minutes. Iteration 74 just fired at 20:30 UTC.\n- **Active Orchestrator Process:** `task-12133` (`python3 \"Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/run_cluster_pipeline.py\"`).\n- **Cluster Workers State:**\n  - **Worker 1 (Md Shapon, 8001):** Active shift (started 19:02 UTC, 3.38h active window), advancing Stage 3 Real SEO.\n  - **Worker 2 (Gaming